  speaker: HABIMANA
  subtitle: Ah. Someone stayed late. I'm sorry about the door. Actually, no, I'm
    not, I locked it. My name is Joseph Habimana. I've kept this archive for forty-seven
    years, and tonight you're going to keep it with me. Everything you need is in
    this room, if you look properly. There's a torch on the workbench. You'll want
    it.
